WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.458
Step 1: Open Users → edit staff → Pay Conditions → Employment documents → Edit contract &amp; IFA templates. Company-wide user and employment access is required to edit shared templates; authorised location managers can select reviewed templates.

2
00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:22.417
Step 2: Choose New contract template or New IFA template. Give it a clear name, select its agreement type and enter the document title and complete independently reviewed terms.

3
00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:38.000
Step 3: Focus the title or agreement text, then use Insert staff field. Fields include staff name, email, legal employer, location, dates, employment type, classification and available award rates. The live preview uses the selected employee’s saved details; example previews are labelled. Missing values are never guessed.

4
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:52.625
Step 4: Enter the legal / employment review reference, confirm ordinary execution requirements and mark Reviewed and ready to use. Save template. Unreviewed drafts cannot be sent; editing terms clears readiness until reviewed again. Archive retires a template while retaining issued documents and signatures.

5
00:00:52.625 --> 00:01:08.833
Step 5: Return to Pay Conditions, save any staff or pay changes, then select the contract, IFA or both. Review selected documents shows the exact filled text before Send selected documents. Updated staff, pay or template details require a fresh review. IFAs for minors need a separate guardian account.
